msgstr "텍스트는 작성한 그대로지만 서명 키가 만료되었습니다."

#: app/src/protection.rs:650
msgid "Signed by {signer}, whose certificate has run out"
msgstr "{signer}의 서명, 인증서 만료됨"

#: app/src/protection.rs:654
msgid ""
"The text is as it was written, and the certificate behind it has expired."
msgstr "텍스트는 작성한 그대로지만 서명 인증서가 만료되었습니다."

#: app/src/protection.rs:660
msgid "Signed by {signer}, who took this key back"
